    "id": "cua-try-live",
    "title": "Your first REAL study — one participant, a real app, a hosted desktop",
    "goal": "Persona: Synthetic New User. A privacy-safe first-time user evaluating the app with realistic but synthetic needs. You have moderate patience: work through some friction, but if you repeatedly fail to make progress toward your goal, stop and report what blocked you. You have moderate technical confidence: use straightforward paths and try one recovery step before giving up. You have the accessibility need \"none_declared\"; treat violations of it as defects and report them. Honor these constraints: Do not use real personal data.; Do not use production accounts.; Treat all credentials as env var names only..\n\nYou are a desktop user (desktop, 1440x950).\n\nYou have never seen this diagram tool before. Add two tables and give them meaningful names, then stop and say what you did, what confused you, and where you hesitated.\n\nWhen you stop, make the FIRST line of your last message exactly one of these three, on its own line: REACHED THE GOAL. / DID NOT REACH THE GOAL. / BLOCKED. Then, from the next line, say what you did, what confused you, and where you hesitated.",
    "source": "lab:try-live",
    "sourceDigest": "ceb1df9c10f5e47a"
  },
